{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/fc2f46c3f0d58243732be6176ff1a158.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Piece</strong> is a deck-building roguelite inspired by classic board games, offering simple rules with deeply strategic gameplay. In a world shrouded by black mist, set out on an expedition with your own band of mercenaries to uncover the secrets hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your strategy, deploy mercenaries, and lead them to victory. Strengthen your units and combine their traits to create powerful synergies \u2014 only then will you survive the perilous journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While <i>Master of Piece</i> is easy to learn, mastering it requires insight and experience. We look forward to seeing how your meticulous strategies and creative solutions will conquer the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler with Simple Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you spend action points to deploy mercenaries onto the battlefield.<br>Once the battle begins, mercenaries act automatically in order of their Speed, so it\u2019s crucial to position them wisely during deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though combat follows a straightforward structure where outcomes depend on stats, achieving victory requires careful consideration of every element that takes effect during the battle \u2014 traits, obstacles, flag health, and status effects.<br>A single misjudgment can change the entire flow of battle\u00a0\u2014 <strong>make wise decisions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Traits, Relics, and Rumors for Endless Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2dcdb5f471de40383b1672413a6a5f7d.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Piece</strong> is designed to be intuitive and accessible, yet it demands complex strategic thinking \u2014 combining mercenary traits, managing relics, and optimizing your commander\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This creates a gameplay experience where <i>easy learning</i> and <i>deep challenge</i> coexist in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit mercenary pieces instead of cards, and build your deck as you form the band of mercenaries. Each mercenary has unique traits that trigger during battle \u2014 and up to two traits can be combined per mercenary, enabling endless synergies and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your team grows stronger and achieves victories, rumors begin to spread  \u2014 just as they did about legendary soldiers of the past. Rumors grant special abilities that are distinct from traits or upgrades. If one of your mercenaries has earned renown, visit the tavern to spread the rumors about him and amplify your team\u2019s synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Failure Is Not the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8d54bd22ca3f72aa7d4f55c71ed7abe7.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through this harsh world may end in failure \u2014 but every defeat becomes the seed of new potential.<br>With over 100 mercenaries and traits, 30 relics, and 20 cards, each run offers a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources gained from failed expeditions to construct facilities at the <i>Outpost</i>. These buildings provide permanent upgrades: more usable items, stronger mercenaries, and other powerful advantages for future journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Powerful Foes at the <i>Building Events</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the regions, you\u2019ll encounter various buildings where you can combine traits, banish useless mercenaries, and purchase relics or items to prepare for battles ahead. Grow stronger to face the formidable forces of evil that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Card Encounters Along the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough decisions don\u2019t only happen in battle. During your journey, you\u2019ll encounter random card events \u2014 brief stories where your choices directly shape the outcome. Will your decisions bring fortune to your expedition, or lead them into peril? As the commander, the fate of your team rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3009310?t=1767834037","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/8ec8c0a20d9f0e9dfe5259b398ee9e7ebea5498f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767834037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/d4d10cad9973b134812bd1c1393697d7ab56bc6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767834037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/d4d10cad9973b134812bd1c1393697d7ab56bc6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767834037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3572950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Read This First!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/e9c7b62d30f119d4f356bf81828c211d.avif?t=1767834037\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/fc2f46c3f0d58243732be6176ff1a158.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Piece</strong> is a deck-building roguelite inspired by classic board games, offering simple rules with deeply strategic gameplay. In a world shrouded by black mist, set out on an expedition with your own band of mercenaries to uncover the secrets hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/43ab6e981f51a1811673fa5b1d1c9eb0.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your strategy, deploy mercenaries, and lead them to victory. Strengthen your units and combine their traits to create powerful synergies \u2014 only then will you survive the perilous journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While <i>Master of Piece</i> is easy to learn, mastering it requires insight and experience. We look forward to seeing how your meticulous strategies and creative solutions will conquer the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler with Simple Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2c372421dc3bd734a7b28329ea5d2650.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you spend action points to deploy mercenaries onto the battlefield.<br>Once the battle begins, mercenaries act automatically in order of their Speed, so it\u2019s crucial to position them wisely during deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though combat follows a straightforward structure where outcomes depend on stats, achieving victory requires careful consideration of every element that takes effect during the battle \u2014 traits, obstacles, flag health, and status effects.<br>A single misjudgment can change the entire flow of battle\u00a0\u2014 <strong>make wise decisions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Traits, Relics, and Rumors for Endless Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/2dcdb5f471de40383b1672413a6a5f7d.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of Piece</strong> is designed to be intuitive and accessible, yet it demands complex strategic thinking \u2014 combining mercenary traits, managing relics, and optimizing your commander\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This creates a gameplay experience where <i>easy learning</i> and <i>deep challenge</i> coexist in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit mercenary pieces instead of cards, and build your deck as you form the band of mercenaries. Each mercenary has unique traits that trigger during battle \u2014 and up to two traits can be combined per mercenary, enabling endless synergies and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8b2f225757187e6153c2e34708d4cb20.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your team grows stronger and achieves victories, rumors begin to spread  \u2014 just as they did about legendary soldiers of the past. Rumors grant special abilities that are distinct from traits or upgrades. If one of your mercenaries has earned renown, visit the tavern to spread the rumors about him and amplify your team\u2019s synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Failure Is Not the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/8d54bd22ca3f72aa7d4f55c71ed7abe7.avif?t=1767834037\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through this harsh world may end in failure \u2014 but every defeat becomes the seed of new potential.<br>With over 100 mercenaries and traits, 30 relics, and 20 cards, each run offers a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources gained from failed expeditions to construct facilities at the <i>Outpost</i>. These buildings provide permanent upgrades: more usable items, stronger mercenaries, and other powerful advantages for future journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Powerful Foes at the <i>Building Events</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/9c56e6bdd2dffee6a75139a21c539843.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/c40c38562bb164cc746b25be1232a81d.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the regions, you\u2019ll encounter various buildings where you can combine traits, banish useless mercenaries, and purchase relics or items to prepare for battles ahead. Grow stronger to face the formidable forces of evil that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Card Encounters Along the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.poster.avif?t=1767834037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.webm?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/93db4e5240d22589fd6622a2696f5e62.mp4?t=1767834037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough decisions don\u2019t only happen in battle. During your journey, you\u2019ll encounter random card events \u2014 brief stories where your choices directly shape the outcome. Will your decisions bring fortune to your expedition, or lead them into peril? As the commander, the fate of your team rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["I M GAME"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/a4a43006a1abba2b64fde512a62483fed54a7ead/header.jpg?t=1767834037","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5350U (2 * 1800) or equivalent; Intel Core i5-2400S (4 * 2500) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 6000 or equivalent; Radeon HD 6750M (512 VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 (4 * 3200) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 M390 (2048 VRAM) equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3009310/1613208190/bd498cc2ab72bdc30ad8af93ed592b5ecd35deec/1760415625/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760415803","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3009310/1613208190/bd498cc2ab72bdc30ad8af93ed592b5ecd35deec/1760415625/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760415803","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3009310/1613208190/bd498cc2ab72bdc30ad8af93ed592b5ecd35deec/1760415625/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760415803","id":257216821,"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216821/8a4d89ace9e38f80948e037d6dc4cdec5c0893da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17604